  "note": "Umetsu+2020 (ApJ 890, 148), VizieR J/ApJ/890/148/table2: HSC-SSP weak-lensing analysis of 136 X-ray-selected XXL groups and clusters. M200/M500 are the WEAK-LENSING masses from the HSC shear analysis; M200MT/M500MT are the bias-corrected, weak-lensing-CALIBRATED mass estimates derived via the M-T relation. T300kpc is the same 300 kpc-aperture X-ray temperature as in the XXL catalogue. Reaches M500 = 0.05e14 Msun (5e12), i.e. well into the group regime. Shares the XLSSC identifier with xxl365gc_clusters.tsv but NO join has been performed here.",
